>First, why did I get it? I was sacrificing stuff hoping to get Mjolnir
>(thanks for everyone who told me how to convert an altar), and just
>kept getting four-leaf clovers and hopeful feelings. Finally I just
>stood on the altar and prayed, and Voom! Odin made me his Envoy of
